# Skill: ask-codex

Single source of truth: `~/.agent-federation/global/CODEX_DIALOGUE.md`.

Use `ask-codex` for one-shot Codex review and for multi-turn debate by iterating the
same call — there is no separate dialogue skill.

```bash
~/.agent-federation/bin/ask-codex --cwd "$PWD" "<prompt>"
```

Treat output as advisory, verify before acting, and do not send secrets.
